    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544-a1">

                <pb facs="0853" n="725" xml:id="pg725"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    333.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Blanc to Mr. Foster</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Italy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1885-06-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 27,
                    1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Referring to the notes addressed to
                    me by your legation, dated February 28, March 3, April 20, May 30, and June 11
                    ultimo, in regard to the high commission which the Governments of the United
                    States of America and Spain did me the honor to intrust tome, I fulfill the duty
                    by sending to your excellency the arbitral decision rendered by me for the
                    indemnity to be paid to the owner of the Masonic.</p>
                <p>At the same time I address an identical communication to his excellency the
                    minister of state of His Majesty the King of Spain.</p>
                <p>Receive, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>BLANC.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
